  "title": "Bank of America Increases Common Stock Dividend fourteen percent 14% to zero dollars point three two $0.32 Per Share",
  "summary": "Bank of America Corporation today announced that the Board of Directors declared a regular quarterly cash dividend on Bank of America common stock of $0.32 per share, up $0.04 from the prior quarter, an increase of 14%. The dividend is payable on September 25, 2026 to shareholders of record as of September 4, 2026.",
